sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente (navegador)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant A as Auth
    participant O as Orders
    participant I as Inventory
    participant P as Payments
    C->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders {items:[{product_id, qty}]} + cookie
    GW->>A: introspect(token)
    A-->>GW: {user_id, role:customer}
    GW->>O: POST /internal/orders (edge + X-Auth-User/Role)
    O->>I: POST /products/batch (precios vigentes)
    I-->>O: nombre, precio
    O->>I: POST /reservations {order_id, items} (atómico)
    I-->>O: reserva activa
    O-->>GW: 201 pedido awaiting_payment (total del servidor)
    GW-->>C: 201
    C->>GW: POST /orders/{id}/pay
    GW->>O: pay (identidad verificada)
    O->>P: POST /payments {order_id, user_id, amount del pedido guardado}
    P-->>O: payment_id, provider_ref
    O-->>C: provider_ref (vía gateway)
    C->>GW: POST /payments/{ref}/sandbox-decision {approve}
    GW->>P: decide (dueño del pago)
    P->>GW: POST /webhooks/payments (evento firmado HMAC)
    GW->>P: reenvía bytes + firma
    P->>P: verifica firma, tolerancia, event_id único, monto
    P->>O: payment-result {succeeded, amount}
    O->>O: awaiting_payment → paid (transición atómica)
    O->>I: commit reserva (stock físico)
    O-->>P: ok
    P-->>GW: 200 processed
    C->>GW: GET /orders/{id}
    GW-->>C: status = paid
